id: motivating-performance
name: Motivating Performance
order: 6
optionOf: show-stopping-performance
optionEffect: 1
description: >
  When using the Hype Maneuver, all Allies within a Sphere AoE centered on you have their Combat Rolls increased by 1/4 (rounded up) of your Personality Modifier while you are Hyped.
text: >
  Motivating Performance [Triggered, 1/Round]: When using the Hype Maneuver, all Allies within a Sphere AoE centered on you have their Combat Rolls increased by 1/4 (rounded up) of your Personality Modifier while you are Hyped.

---

# The Hype Maneuver used: who stands within the Sphere ticked - the table's - Motivated on each, its stacks that quarter,
# taken off them as your Hyped goes (chat.mjs motivatingPerformance, motivatedLeft). Automatic by default, its
# Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/hype, 1/round, effect 1]
motivatingPerformance();
